{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14216120","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14216120","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1421612001:1":{"text":"미나, 어디 좀 봐. 다친 데는 없어? 낙인도 안 찍혔지?","source_cn":"米娜，让我看看你！没有受伤，也没有被施加印记！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ADEA2527307B3AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1421612002:1":{"text":"무사해서 정말 다행이야. 얼마나 걱정했다고!","source_cn":"你没事真是太好了！我一直在担心你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B28102BC1B486F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421612003:1":{"text":"들판에서 위험한 상황에 놓였는데, 다행히 에반과 멀린 님이 제때 도와주셨어...","source_cn":"我在野外遇到了危险，幸好埃文和这位梅林大人及时找到了我……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xB4DFAEE95BB27318","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"들판에서 위험한 상황에 놓였는데, 다행히 에반과 멀린 님이 제때 도와주셨어...","female":"들판에서 위험한 상황에 놓였는데, 다행히 에반과 멀린 님이 제때 도와주셨어...","variant_male_record_index":"165386","variant_female_record_index":"165387","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421612004:1":{"text":"이런 얘기는 됐고... 델린! 혹시 남은 코코넛 기름 있어? 에반이 급하게 찾고 있는데 지금 시장에서 구할 수가 없대!","source_cn":"不说这些了，德琳，你这里有没有多余的香椰油？埃文有急用...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9BF9D9FFA074DECA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421612005:1":{"text":"있기는 한데, 많지 않아서... 괜찮아, 가져가! 일단 에반부터 도와야지!","source_cn":"有是有，但只剩下最后一点了……没事，你拿走吧！先帮埃文...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9906034596A51798","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421612006:1":{"text":"너희 주인님에게 들키면...","source_cn":"如果被你的主人发现……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB82A3DEE5DCAC2DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1421612007:1":{"text":"들키면 그때 너희에게 도와달라고 할게! 그땐 모른 척하면 안 돼!","source_cn":"如果被发现，我再来找你们帮忙嘛！等那个时候，你可不要不管我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x047DE8E42E371FDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1421612008:1":{"text":"알았어. 그럼 시장으로 에반을 만나러 갈게. 모든 일이 끝나고 에반이 와서 감사 인사를 하러 올 거야!","source_cn":"我明白了，我先去市集找埃文，事情解决后他一定会亲自来感...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC87121B95977D6BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:女仆德琳":{"text":"메이드 델린","source":"女仆德琳","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:女仆米娜":{"text":"메이드 미나","source":"女仆米娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":9,"localized_text_count":8,"speaker_count":2}}